But they also have many differences.
Daxue likes warm tree holes,
Xiaoxue loves the biting cold wind;
Daxue likes drinking hot soup,
Xiaoxue likes chewing ice cubes;
Daxue likes sleeping in bed,
Xiaoxue prefers lying in the snow;
Daxue's body is growing slowly,
Xiaoxue is gradually shrinking.
